WEBVTT

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:37.450
Is he... back?

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:39.750
Gauche!

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:46.000
Light Shines on the Darkness

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.250
Gauche!

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.500
Wait!

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.390
He is needed to save the world.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:57.300
Lag Seeing... I will not 
give Noir over to you!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.260
Roda...

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.250
Roda, you're...

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:08.270
That's...

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:11.770
A bird? No...

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:13.470
It's gaichuu!

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:16.460
Shindan loaded.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.640
Stop it, Lag!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:27.850
Those are swarming-type gaichuu.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:30.330
A giant group of Lao-Lao!

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:33.130
Take some Blue Thorns!

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:41.840
There'll be no end to it 
shooting down 2 or 3 at a time!

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.890
Shindan loaded... Red Needle!

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:55.810
So in the end it's our job 
to stop these boys, eh?

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.820
What's the toy for?

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:03.790
This? It's a device that can control 
gaichuu using giant ultrasonic waves.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.740
Say what?! Gimme!

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:11.790
And then...

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:19.150
I like it!

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:24.760
We won't let you interfere until 
the Cabernet heads out, boy.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.320
My leg...

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.830
Crap, if only I'd brought Wasiolka!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:54.580
If we get attacked like that again...

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:58.200
If I had Niche with me now...

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.850
Lag!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:20.110
Thank goodness... You're all better!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:23.740
You came back for me, Niche...

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:26.990
Her hair can do that too?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:33.990
Steak says they're full of holes! Fire, Lag!

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:37.740
Thanks Niche, Steak!

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:41.480
Here we go... Nocturne Op. 20...

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:44.580
The bullet that I shoot is 
a fragment of my heart...

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:50.600
His heart is overflowing because 
his dingo came back to him, eh?

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:55.230
Shindan loaded... Resound Red Needle!

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:03.740
He pierced through all the 
Lao-Lao in just one shot...

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.410
Lag!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.940
Niche!

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:13.750
Put on your underwear!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.550
Do you have more spirits, Lag?

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.480
Spirits?

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:31.330
Aria said so in the Bee Hive...

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.890
That without Niche with him, 
Lag would be low in spirits.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:39.650
Yeah...

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:44.040
I have them. They came back to 
me together with you, Niche.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.400
That's my Niche for you.

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:56.480
Niche... Niche?

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:00.290
Steak, what's wrong with Niche?

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:04.920
Sorry, Lag... I'm sleepy...

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:09.080
Wait, is your body not fully healed yet?

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:16.560
They said not to go yet... 
But I'm your dingo, so...

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:19.070
Niche.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:23.820
Where's Noir?

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.190
Hey!

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:41.770
Lag Seeing?

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.290
Give me a hand, Zazie!

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:46.740
Hey, Lag! She's our enemy!

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:48.490
She's Noir's dingo!

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:50.460
That's right! I'm...

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:51.990
You're Roda!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:57.440
You said that you were fused with 
all sorts of animals at the capital.

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:01.810
I bet that one of them had 
to be Gauche's dingo, Roda!

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.710
I don't remember anything.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:12.000
That must be it... So that 
makes me your friend.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.320
Friend?

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:19.760
The reason you protect Noir must 
be because you remember Gauche!

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:23.060
If you pass away, Gauche will be sad!

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.180
Sad?

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:30.880
I'm going to bring Gauche's 
heart back! And if I do...

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:39.100
You can do it! You can do it, Roda!

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.480
You are such a troublesome boy.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:47.650
Your heart has a mysterious way 
of swaying deep within my breast.

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:53.370
Roda!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:58.360
A place deep inside my heart... 
is slightly warmer...

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:10.340
But I am Reverse's Roda.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.460
Roda!

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.340
She chose that herself?

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.730
The letter bullet!

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:25.190
But, why? Roda...

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.780
I'll do something about that guy.

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:36.920
You take Noir. Go after Gauche-san!

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:38.190
Zazie...

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:40.660
This time you'd better shoot 
that letter bullet into him!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.780
Go!

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:42.790
Right!

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:57.020
Gauche!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.450
Gauche!

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:06.420
Gauche... You're back, right?

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:10.440
It's me... It's Lag Seeing.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:19.870
We are no longer friends, Lag.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:25.080
I am a Marauder for Reverse, 
and my name is Noir.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:28.720
I will rob you of your life.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:41.860
My heart... didn't reach him?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.930
Gauche, I...

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:54.440
Those are...

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.570
Land mines?

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.580
Connor! Sunny...

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.720
Sunny?

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:12.050
I didn't get there in time.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:15.230
I couldn't save her.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:23.450
Her kind heart was completely, completely, 
completely eaten by that gaichuu!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.350
And how...

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:35.400
And how will this save the world?

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:38.950
Stealing innocent people's hearts?

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:42.940
There is something more important than heart.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.780
Don't you guys understand?

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:48.580
About the people grieving for 
those who've lost their hearts?

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:51.530
Grieving people?

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:53.080
Noir!

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.100
I've seen your memories of Reverse.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:02.670
And if they are the truth, I thought 
I could understand you a little bit.

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.910
But no longer.

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.450
I won't forgive this!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.840
So, what will you do about it?

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.190
Your shindan does not have 
the power to harm or kill.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:18.230
No matter how many times you try it, 
you will never resonate with my heart.

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:21.670
Only Noir exists in my heart.

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:26.740
Gauche Suede can never be brought back again.

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:47.680
I wanted to go and join 
in the fight against Noir,

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.490
but I'm too far away to look for the gaps.

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:52.350
And its size ain't nothin' 
to scoff at either.

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:55.510
Damn, this ain't so good.

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:58.100
I don't see any way to win.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:03.860
The Cabernet has acquired plenty 
of power to capture the capital.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:09.420
The symbol of the stratified society, 
the artificial sun, will soon go out.

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:11.360
The world will become one.

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:13.920
Under the darkness.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.760
He erased my shindan?

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.050
What is that light?

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:36.270
His entire body is glowing... 
Almost like... Almost like...

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.110
I'm not going to bring back Gauche...

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:45.630
Noir! I'm going to erase you from existance!

00:12:56.850 --> 00:13:00.290
Lag, have you ever written 
a letter to someone before?

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.540
Then one day, please try writing one.

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:21.740
What is that?

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:25.820
The Cabernet is aiming for that light?

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:30.780
It's returned. Drawn by the 
light of Lag's heart...

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.840
Wait here, Sunny.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:43.500
If you want to eat people's hearts so much, 
come this way! My heart is right here!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:46.620
Idiot, stop that Connor!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.710
You're just leaving yourself 
open to attack being below it!

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:52.990
Connor!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.470
Shindan loaded!

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:59.500
Huh? What's wrong? My hand...

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.810
You used too much heart 
with the letter bullet!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.620
If you shoot any more shindans, 
you'll lose your heart!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.320
Gauche!

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.320
Lag!

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:22.460
The light of my Spirit Amber is weak...

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.960
I don't have much heart remaining...

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:27.680
Lag...

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:38.480
Gauche!

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:41.280
Wake up, Gauche!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.200
Gauche!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:49.080
No! At this rate, his heart 
will be stolen by the gaichuu.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.580
I have no choice but to shoot a shindan.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.050
Even if I use up all my heart,

00:14:55.050 --> 00:15:01.510
I will deliver Gauche Suede to 
Sylvette, Aria, and the Bee Hive!

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.060
Shindan loaded!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.050
Where? Where is its weakpoint?

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.000
My hand is shaking...

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:16.980
Aim for the base of the back left wing.

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:22.440
Cabernet have many gaps. First 
we must disrupt its flight.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.790
Noir?

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:26.230
Gauche?

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:29.350
Both of us have little heart remaining.

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:31.650
We will shoot together into the gap.

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:33.450
Simultaneous shindans?

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:36.210
If you put in too much, 
you will lose your heart.

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.740
You will lose everything.

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.160
You will cause grief to the 
people precious to you.

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:44.200
Let us go!

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:45.640
Right!

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.000
Load!

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.520
Resound, heart!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.680
Lag!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.060
Niche!

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:17.190
Lag!

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:19.990
Where's Gauche-san?

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:24.120
He was awake, but he's 
lost consciousness again.

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:26.180
Is he back?

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:28.440
I don't know.

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:35.120
So Connor's going to stay in the city, right?

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.160
Yeah...

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:41.230
He believes that Sunny will wake up one day.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.320
I'm heading after the Cabernet.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:48.370
It didn't look like it was going toward 
the capital, but we can't leave it alone.

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:49.270
Yeah.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:55.200
If you let Dr. Thunderland see Gauche-san 
in the Bee Hive, he'll be awake in no time.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.080
So, what did you write?

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:21.390
The letter you packed into 
the letter bullet for Gauche.

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:25.030
I wrote: "I miss you, Gauche."

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.350
Huh? That's it?

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:28.830
Yeah.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.300
Even a single word will do.

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:38.120
As long as there is someone who will shed 
a tear of happiness when they receive it.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.010
I'm sure it reached him.

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:46.780
My letter...

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.090
No reaction?

00:17:55.980 --> 00:18:00.140
Give him 4 mls of La-5, then 
observe him for a while.

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:01.240
Right.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:03.600
What is it?

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.870
Come in, Seeing.

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:08.090
Um, how is Gauche?

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:11.660
So far he has had no outward response.

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:14.820
There's no issue with his heart level,

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:18.280
so there must be some other 
reason he hasn't woken up.

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:20.140
Lag Seeing.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.250
The Master awaits your report.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.350
Right!

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.030
Aria-san?

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:43.740
I never thought... I would be able to...

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:48.070
...see him again...

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.070
Thank you, Lag.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.160
He is Gauche, right?

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.820
I don't know.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:03.030
I see.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.580
But I felt it.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.250
His strong, kind heart.

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:17.560
I... I know it well...

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:22.020
The strong, kind person he was.

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:41.090
Next: Crimson Melody {this is the name of Aria's Shindan, I'm pretty sure}
